From 539d81cb9a46b9ee1a8bc4e7b73440230ff17b90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrey Stoyan <andrey.stoyan.csam@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 04:56:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/43] test(chexc): property accessor and primary constructor
 clause coverage

Pins audit MF1 (accessor clauses demanded at every use site, with generic
instantiation through the receiver) and MF6 (primary constructor clauses
surviving desugaring), plus positive twins guarding against over-demanding.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
