 .../scopes/prop_accessor_demand.cj            | 62 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../scopes/prop_accessor_demand_neg.cj        | 49 +++++++++++++++
 .../types/prop_accessor_generic.cj            | 34 ++++++++++
